+shots_on_target_per90,player,playerMetrics.shotsOnTargetPer90.label,Shots on target per 90 minutes played. Minutes-normalised. Null when minutes is zero.,shots_on_target,minutes / 90,false,decimal_1,shooting,,1,higher_better,How often the player tests the keeper; high = a persistent attacking threat.
+key_passes_per90,player,playerMetrics.keyPassesPer90.label,Key passes (passes leading to a shot) per 90 minutes played. Minutes-normalised. Null when minutes is zero.,passes_key,minutes / 90,false,decimal_1,passing,,2,higher_better,Shot-creating passes; high = a creative hub who makes chances.
+dribbles_success_per90,player,playerMetrics.dribblesSuccessPer90.label,Successful dribbles per 90 minutes played. Minutes-normalised. Null when minutes is zero.,dribbles_success,minutes / 90,false,decimal_1,duels,,2,higher_better,Take-ons completed; high = a dangerous ball-carrier who beats opponents.
+passes_per90,player,playerMetrics.passesPer90.label,Passes attempted per 90 minutes played. Minutes-normalised. Null when minutes is zero.,passes_total,minutes / 90,false,decimal_1,passing,,1,neutral,Passing involvement; high = a possession-anchoring role; low = a more direct role. Style not quality.
+tackles_per90,player,playerMetrics.tacklesPer90.label,Tackles per 90 minutes played. Minutes-normalised. Null when minutes is zero.,tackles_total,minutes / 90,false,decimal_1,defending,,1,neutral,Tackling volume; high = an aggressive ball-winner; low = positional. Style not quality - high can reflect a side often defending.
+interceptions_per90,player,playerMetrics.interceptionsPer90.label,Interceptions per 90 minutes played. Minutes-normalised. Null when minutes is zero.,tackles_interceptions,minutes / 90,false,decimal_1,defending,,1,neutral,Interception volume; high = reads play and steps into passing lanes. Style not quality.
+blocks_per90,player,playerMetrics.blocksPer90.label,Blocks per 90 minutes played. Minutes-normalised. Null when minutes is zero.,tackles_blocks,minutes / 90,false,decimal_1,defending,,1,neutral,Blocks made; high = throws the body in; often a side under pressure. Style not quality.
+defensive_actions_per90,player,playerMetrics.defensiveActionsPer90.label,Defensive actions (tackles + interceptions + blocks) per 90 minutes played. Minutes-normalised. Null when minutes is zero.,tackles + interceptions + blocks,minutes / 90,false,decimal_1,defending,,1,neutral,Overall defensive workload (tackles + interceptions + blocks); high = a deep block or aggressive press. Style not quality.
+duels_won_per90,player,playerMetrics.duelsWonPer90.label,Duels won per 90 minutes played. Minutes-normalised. Null when minutes is zero.,duels_won,minutes / 90,false,decimal_1,duels,,1,neutral,Physical duels won; high = heavily and successfully involved in duels. Volume - the win rate captures efficiency.
+saves_per90,player,playerMetrics.savesPer90.label,Goalkeeper saves per 90 minutes played. Minutes-normalised. Null when minutes is zero.,goals_saves,minutes / 90,false,decimal_1,goalkeeping,,1,neutral,Save volume; high = a busy keeper facing many shots; not shot-stopping quality - the save rate captures that.
